    "name": "9 Hostel and Bar",
    "detail": "Ignore that cheesy tittle LoL All jokes aside this place is perfectly located and just in 5-10mins walk you will be in Bui Vien - the famous backpacker district of Saigon. Around the hostel there are plenty of shops like Cycle more like 7Eleven you will find in Bangkok and other great places to eat and visit. Have I mentioned how comfortable the dorm beds are and how friendly and helpful the staffs are. Overall, its a fantastic place to stay and the toilet are clean but bring your own soap because they do not provide that and I wish they do. Just on piece of advise just have an open mind when your visit Ho Chi Minh City because come during peek time motorbikes are everywhere even on the footpath which is crazy yo and the Vietnamese people won’t stop steering at my chocolate skin ahah",
